<!--
  wp81_notify_missed_call - the mark a missed call wears in the shade

  Derived from Templarian/WindowsIcons (Modern UI Icons), CC BY 3.0.
  Source: WindowsPhone/svg/appbar.phone.hangup.svg

  Built the way wp81_notification_music is, and for the reason set out there: the glyphs in
  this set are drawn on a 76x76 grid with the mark filling about half of it, which is right
  on a tile - the air keeps it off the tile's edges - and wrong for a notification, where
  Android scales the whole canvas into a fixed box and the air goes with it. The path is
  untouched; the viewport is the mark's own bounding box plus two units, and the group
  shifts the drawing into it.

  Emitted white on transparent: Android draws a small icon from its alpha channel and tints
  the silhouette itself, so the colour here is only what keeps the shape visible in a
  preview.
-->
